----------------------------------------------------------------------

Koda reproduces the method of Eureka: Human-Level Reward Design via Coding
Large Language Models (ICLR 2024). No Eureka code is included.

rl_zoo3_balancer (https://codeberg.org/upkie/rl_zoo3_balancer) is used as
an external comparison baseline. No code from it is included.
